@bank all
// CL1 (0.99.7, plans/patch-0997.md notes 14, 26, 31; stand-in words for the writers to reword). Read only with
// CAL997_ON (section 18's slot 'Calendar builder'). TEXTS: shown by the game, said by nobody.
//   cal.lead.<id>     the arrow's label while it leads you to that tradition ({time} its start, {place} its room)
//   cal.address.call  the notice at 15:30 on a short Friday: the Captain's address, and the arrow to it
//   cal.address.title its title

== cal.lead.pick-your-own
- Pick-your-own breakfast, {time}: {place}

== cal.lead.harvest
- Harvest morning, {time}: {place}

== cal.lead.captains-address
- The Captain's address, {time}: {place}

== cal.lead.lastLightGlass
- The Last Light, {time}: {place}

== cal.address.title
- The Captain's address

== cal.address.call
- The whole ship meets in the Rec deck auditorium at four. Follow the arrow, find a seat.
